                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3d924a0d-0a5b-3dd7-a7f9-6151bf33214c",
                                        "entry_id": "c2943b50-d5bc-3feb-b75e-01a01865173b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The state of being loyal; fidelity."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5c9b4c79-d242-4819-b23e-a463ad219a88",
                                                "sense_id": "3d924a0d-0a5b-3dd7-a7f9-6151bf33214c",
                                                "text": "brand loyalty"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c441ffd5-9f72-3024-8fe4-2398a38d93b2",
                                        "entry_id": "c2943b50-d5bc-3feb-b75e-01a01865173b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Faithfulness or devotion to some person, cause or nation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "df6a5492-a093-4600-a726-afb780122597",
                                                "sense_id": "c441ffd5-9f72-3024-8fe4-2398a38d93b2",
                                                "text": "He showed loyalty to his local football club after successive relegations."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bfff2c84-3edf-48c4-9c59-45aa627b0136",
                                                "sense_id": "c441ffd5-9f72-3024-8fe4-2398a38d93b2",
                                                "text": "Over the violence and the proud loyalties, over the sold-out-ness and the cruel indifference, there is light reclothing us in a kind of strange innocence."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5224b406-6606-4c9c-82ce-d35fb46b1c09",
                                                "sense_id": "c441ffd5-9f72-3024-8fe4-2398a38d93b2",
                                                "text": "The only responsibility and power of the Vice President under the Constitution is to faithfully count the electoral college votes as they have been cast.\nThe Constitution does not empower the Vice President to alter in any way the votes that have been cast, either by rejecting certain of them or otherwise.\nHow the Vice President discharges this constitutional obligation is not a question of his loyalty to the President any more than it would be a test of a President’s loyalty to his Vice President\nwhether the President assented to the impeachment and prosecution of his Vice President for the commission of high crimes while in office.\nNo President and no Vice President would—or should—consider either event as a test of political loyalty of one to the other.\nAnd if either did, he would have to accept that political loyalty must yield to constitutional obligation.\nNeither the President nor the Vice President has any higher loyalty than to the Constitution."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "58ac1edf-56e7-4652-874e-4e8ca6da0d9c",
                                                "sense_id": "c441ffd5-9f72-3024-8fe4-2398a38d93b2",
                                                "text": "One reason why many Asian countries oppose dual nationality is a belief that it can create divided loyalties among citizens, said Jelena Dzankic, co-director of the Global Citizenship Observatory (GLOBALCIT), an international citizenship research network. […] Japan drafted its current nationality laws shortly after World War II, when many Japanese Americans were put in internment camps in the US; other dual citizens renounced their loyalty to the Japanese Emperor for their own safety, said Atsushi Kondo, a law professor at Japan’s Meijo University."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "684ef495-3c76-49e6-8f63-0674e4fbbaa7",
                        "source_entry_id": "3bcf2bd7-a690-301f-8566-d887f6e3d314",
                        "source_sense_id": "29b9eac4-3417-3d48-b6f7-387ff91d8507",
                        "target_lang_word": "allegiance",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "allegiance",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "09cfee9e-3a8a-324b-a14d-aaae33d9d514",
                                        "entry_id": "0f4e4914-7322-31cb-b6b1-d171d0cead2b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Loyalty to some cause, nation or ruler."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "58c5adc1-1fbe-44ea-aa43-7a509f2cac78",
                                                "sense_id": "09cfee9e-3a8a-324b-a14d-aaae33d9d514",
                                                "text": "With what a feeling of joyful security did her heart go back to its old allegiance! Till now she had scarcely been aware of its strength, for she had known it but by its disappointment—now she fully admitted that early and passionate emotion with which Robert Evelyn had inspired her was indeed her destiny;..."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "40a84611-bc08-40ea-a677-e6b6d73e2502",
                                                "sense_id": "09cfee9e-3a8a-324b-a14d-aaae33d9d514",
                                                "text": "It was always going to be a hot occasion for Declan Rice and Jack Grealish, the one-time Ireland internationals who subsequently switched their allegiances."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f6e0714d-4072-44e4-af6f-1250ef8dfdb1",
                        "source_entry_id": "3bcf2bd7-a690-301f-8566-d887f6e3d314",
                        "source_sense_id": "29b9eac4-3417-3d48-b6f7-387ff91d8507",
                        "target_lang_word": "loajalita",
                        "target_lang_code": "cs",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "loajalita",
                                "target_lang_code": "cs",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ca09a3d8-bca7-3eeb-8f89-7c0e24fb89e7",
                                        "entry_id": "64641fc5-51ee-3178-91ed-e2a7411eaa64",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "věrnost nadřazenému subjektu"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6eea257d-9a35-4afd-8dad-c572d61397ec",
                                                "sense_id": "ca09a3d8-bca7-3eeb-8f89-7c0e24fb89e7",
                                                "text": "Zatímco v někdejších pohraničních oblastech projevilo tamní německé obyvatelstvo naprostou loajalitu vůči nacistickému Německu, v Protektorátu Čechy a Morava zavládly persekuce a teror, k nimž nemalou měrou přispěl K. H. Frank, oceněný dokonce i funkcí státního ministra pro celé okupované území."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f7d80c1a-46ed-4a57-8b3d-0530ebfb4cb9",
                                                "sense_id": "ca09a3d8-bca7-3eeb-8f89-7c0e24fb89e7",
                                                "text": "Spojují v sobě maximum osobní svobody s maximem loajality."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c154630e-14c7-4799-85dd-401952321420",
                        "source_entry_id": "3bcf2bd7-a690-301f-8566-d887f6e3d314",
                        "source_sense_id": "29b9eac4-3417-3d48-b6f7-387ff91d8507",
                        "target_lang_word": "loajálnost",
                        "target_lang_code": "cs",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d327eaed-8848-4ce0-a263-1b35f36c9f4e",
                        "source_entry_id": "3bcf2bd7-a690-301f-8566-d887f6e3d314",
                        "source_sense_id": "29b9eac4-3417-3d48-b6f7-387ff91d8507",
                        "target_lang_word": "loyauté",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "loyauté",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3c9415db-a7ea-3169-9174-51e2e5c9b997",
                                        "entry_id": "d9e15f4b-d58c-37a0-abc3-994767271fb3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Fidélité à tenir parole, à faire honneur à ses engagements."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0df98325-5f78-40f1-b953-4a32562c0d21",
                                                "sense_id": "3c9415db-a7ea-3169-9174-51e2e5c9b997",
                                                "text": "Il félicita le défenseur de sa « loyauté, » et profita habilement de cette loyauté."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c33b1905-a352-40a4-b0ee-8ce9b8a9ba89",
                                                "sense_id": "3c9415db-a7ea-3169-9174-51e2e5c9b997",
                                                "text": "En somme, il appartenait à la race qui avait fait l’Angleterre et l’Amérique ce qu’elles étaient. […] : sa personne constituait simplement un individu agressif, doué d’un sens aigu de l’appropriation, sans aucun sentiment de la cohésion de l’État, sans loyauté, sans dévouement, sans code d’honneur et même sans code de courage."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ec260551-87a5-421b-bdea-5dea6d2a140f",
                                                "sense_id": "3c9415db-a7ea-3169-9174-51e2e5c9b997",
                                                "text": "M. Fabre représentait l’Honneur, la Loyauté, la Probité, la vie régulière et laborieuse, le livret de Caisse d’Épargne, le pain gagné à la sueur d’un front d’exploité, — bref tout ce que les bourgeois proclament des lèvres comme des vertus civiques."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0877caba-550e-47c3-b12c-8945398bf3d2",
                                                "sense_id": "3c9415db-a7ea-3169-9174-51e2e5c9b997",
                                                "text": "Ce retour, nous l'avons vu, n'est pas la simple rémanence d'un passé tribal et paysan, mais la reconstitution dans une société moderne de modes traditionnels de loyauté et d'exercice du pouvoir : alliances matrimoniales, solidarité des corporations, clientélisme, c'est-à-dire échange de la loyauté politique contre une prébende matérielle."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "aea557d0-6a7e-4786-9e12-5e7b5b62dc39",
                                                "sense_id": "3c9415db-a7ea-3169-9174-51e2e5c9b997",
                                                "text": "L’intégrité journalistique repose largement sur l’absence de conflits de loyautés, et même sur l’absence d’apparence de tels conflits."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d4815502-da58-4f88-9145-9b1b8f007a6c",
                                                "sense_id": "3c9415db-a7ea-3169-9174-51e2e5c9b997",
                                                "text": "Une doctrine claire c’est l’identification et la formulation exempte d’ambiguïtés — condition de la loyauté dans toute discussion privée ou publique — d’idées structurantes."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
